OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new #4m roundabout due to
OL,4,Afinish on time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #4m project to build a roundabout at
OL,7,Fa crash-prone junction is expected to
OL,8,Fbe completed next month, a council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FSomerset Council said the Whitnell
OL,12,FCorner junction on the B3139 Bath Road,
OL,13,Fnear Wells, had been the scene of 67
OL,14,Fcollisions in the past 20 years.
OL,16,FThe work is scheduled for completion
OL,17,Fbetween 11 and 18 December.
OL,19,FCouncillor Richard Wilkins said work
OL,20,Fwas "progressing really well" and the
OL,21,Fcouncil expected the roundabout to
OL,22,F"open to traffic on time".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
